#Script used to complete a generalized linear model analysis of the binomial survival data. It includes a logit link function, over dispersion tests and intervals, and Firth bias-adjusted estimates.

Fit Model(
	Y( :Data ),
	Effects( :Isofemale Line, :Treatment, :Isofemale Line * :Treatment ),
	Personality( "Generalized Linear Model" ),
	GLM Distribution( "Binomial" ),
	Link Function( "Logit" ),
	Overdispersion Tests and Intervals( 1 ),
	"Firth Bias-Adjusted Estimates"n( 1 ),
	Run
);
